<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55027" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρρέπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sink down</i> or <i>to one side, hang down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				43
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσορροπέω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.10.7
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>incline, fall back upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸν μοναχὸν τρόπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.41U.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὴν αὐτὴν γνώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					315.51
				</span></i>
			 (Pessinus, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans., <i>cause to incline, make to
			fall</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχη γὰρ ὀρθοῖ καὶ τύχη καταρρέπει
					τὸν εὐτυχοῦντα τόν τε δυστυχοῦντ᾽ ἀεί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1158
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
